   {'asset': 'http://www.argus-project.eu/instance/colosseum', 'name': 'Colosseum', 'country': 'Italy', 'threat': None, 'riskassessment': None, 'RiskAssessment_MagnitudeOfRisk': None}
  … and 3 more.

